{"channelId":"UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","row":["Mayne Veterinary Clinic",24,"Mayne Veterinary clinic is a small independent veterinary practice on Bergholt Road near North Station in Colchester, UK. We've been making pets feel better since 1975, and that's just one reason why we're such a popular family vet – we've looked after generation after generation of pets for local people. \n\nThat special continuity of care and our famously warm personal service mean we get to know you and your pet well. And we make every effort to make sure you see the same team member each time you visit, something that makes you feel even more comfortable and cared for. It's all about compassion and kindness, which is exactly what you need when your beloved companion is ill or has an injury.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:24.545Z","channelId":"UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"be2f55e0bf3a2c2bf7a5bfcbec7823d4b5515958c75f772f5eaab4e926ebea1e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"85d2a79cbe4e089e04ded329d0a34c1889af52850865ee3e509473cdaac23afc"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":24,"raw":"24 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:24.545Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDYgTL1LWw2XSQTd26bfzcw"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验